    <item>
      <title>发现replit 可以白嫖Seedance 2.0</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2439649</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2439649</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jun 2026 14:20:04 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;打开 Replit 官网并登录个人账号；&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://replit.com/&quot; class=&quot;onebox&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://replit.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在页面输入框中输入指令「Open canvas」&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/b/e/fbef2ed934431f7057723d0f84eb1daa5f59ce95.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/zWIi7BqijvDLt47b5Dh75FNMPLT.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;ScreenShot_2026-06-20_221028_192&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/b/e/fbef2ed934431f7057723d0f84eb1daa5f59ce95_2_690x94.png&quot; alt=&quot;ScreenShot_2026-06-20_221028_192&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;zWIi7BqijvDLt47b5Dh75FNMPLT&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;94&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/b/e/fbef2ed934431f7057723d0f84eb1daa5f59ce95_2_690x94.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/b/e/fbef2ed934431f7057723d0f84eb1daa5f59ce95_2_1035x141.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/b/e/fbef2ed934431f7057723d0f84eb1daa5f59ce95.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;27282B&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
